{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Gobocore: Goblin Rescue Squad ",
    "steam_appid": 2844440,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Auto-Battler</strong> about rescuing your kidnapped tribe members by growing your small tribe of goblins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN BASED BATTLE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/5d1e8928abf7662e7d9611492ecf7152.poster.avif?t=1749554932\" width=598 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/5d1e8928abf7662e7d9611492ecf7152.webm?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/5d1e8928abf7662e7d9611492ecf7152.mp4?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your Goblins will take turns automatically and figure out their own opponents.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The turns can be set to proceed automatically or with a pause on world turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather equipment, choose the best upgrades, and <i>lead your goblins on a chase to track down the kidnappers of their tribe members</i> through a <strong>procedurally generated run</strong>. Your goal is to help them survive and carve out a cozy little place for themselves in this fantasy world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EQUIPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start the game with a weak little goblin, whom you will equip with dingy gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, by evolving your dungeon core and overcoming battles, you will gather life essence from other creatures. You can spend it on upgrades and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/d4cffe41e8c9a4116735376f6e392781.poster.avif?t=1749554932\" width=598 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/d4cffe41e8c9a4116735376f6e392781.webm?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/d4cffe41e8c9a4116735376f6e392781.mp4?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Buy gear in home camp. And equip it to units.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gear you equip and the mutations your goblins gain sometimes contain skill cards that they can manifest. You will be able to use these skill cards to help them achieve victory by playing them on friendly or enemy units.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/f2043963949fd1902fb2303dc639ec16.poster.avif?t=1749554932\" width=598 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/f2043963949fd1902fb2303dc639ec16.webm?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/f2043963949fd1902fb2303dc639ec16.mp4?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill cards are manifestations of your goblin squads hopes. <i>Skill cards are spawned by unit skills and equipment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use them on the battlefield to help your goblins achieve victory. Or Build your squad in a way where you don't have to use any skill cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill cards use Core Mana that dungeon core generates each turn.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter moves time forward by a day. As time passes, the map changes, and new encounters appear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you can also go on smaller <strong>scouting encounters</strong> to improve your chance in your next big battle. They won't move the day forward and will earn you core mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag back loot from these encounters, and continue your chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mutate your goblins. <br>Gain blessings and trinkets. <br>Use your dungeon core abilities during battles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This gloomy world could use some more green in it!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Auto-Battler</strong> about rescuing your kidnapped tribe members by growing your small tribe of goblins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN BASED BATTLE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/5d1e8928abf7662e7d9611492ecf7152.poster.avif?t=1749554932\" width=598 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/5d1e8928abf7662e7d9611492ecf7152.webm?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/5d1e8928abf7662e7d9611492ecf7152.mp4?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your Goblins will take turns automatically and figure out their own opponents.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The turns can be set to proceed automatically or with a pause on world turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather equipment, choose the best upgrades, and <i>lead your goblins on a chase to track down the kidnappers of their tribe members</i> through a <strong>procedurally generated run</strong>. Your goal is to help them survive and carve out a cozy little place for themselves in this fantasy world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EQUIPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start the game with a weak little goblin, whom you will equip with dingy gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, by evolving your dungeon core and overcoming battles, you will gather life essence from other creatures. You can spend it on upgrades and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/d4cffe41e8c9a4116735376f6e392781.poster.avif?t=1749554932\" width=598 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/d4cffe41e8c9a4116735376f6e392781.webm?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/d4cffe41e8c9a4116735376f6e392781.mp4?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Buy gear in home camp. And equip it to units.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gear you equip and the mutations your goblins gain sometimes contain skill cards that they can manifest. You will be able to use these skill cards to help them achieve victory by playing them on friendly or enemy units.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/f2043963949fd1902fb2303dc639ec16.poster.avif?t=1749554932\" width=598 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/f2043963949fd1902fb2303dc639ec16.webm?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844440/extras/f2043963949fd1902fb2303dc639ec16.mp4?t=1749554932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill cards are manifestations of your goblin squads hopes. <i>Skill cards are spawned by unit skills and equipment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use them on the battlefield to help your goblins achieve victory. Or Build your squad in a way where you don't have to use any skill cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill cards use Core Mana that dungeon core generates each turn.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter moves time forward by a day. As time passes, the map changes, and new encounters appear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you can also go on smaller <strong>scouting encounters</strong> to improve your chance in your next big battle. They won't move the day forward and will earn you core mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag back loot from these encounters, and continue your chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mutate your goblins. <br>Gain blessings and trinkets. <br>Use your dungeon core abilities during battles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This gloomy world could use some more green in it!</strong></p>",
